     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Odds for:</p>\n<p>If the probability is <span data-math=\"\\frac{3}{8}\"></span> then the odds for the event are <span data-math=\"\\frac{3}{8}:\\left( {1 - \\frac{3}{8}} \\right)\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{3}{8}:\\frac{5}{8}\"></span></p>\n<p>Multiply both numbers by 8 to clear fractions.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\text{3:5}}\"></span></p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"3{:}5\">3{:}5</span>"
    }
